"""
	Registers an employee using the standard registration screen when the added "middle name" input is active
	Verifies that the entered data saves correctly by checking the demographic view screen
	@systemtype: EH
"""
Begin "Add and Enable system settings"
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "Control Panel" sidemenu entry
	Click the "System" charttab
	Click the "System Settings" charttab subtab
	Begin "Add preferred name in Patient Search"
		Click the "Add System Setting" link
		Enter "Show middle name input on registration screen" into the "System Settings" autocomplete
		Select "Enabled" in the "Value" dropdown
		Type "Chart search test" in the "Reason" input
		Click the "Add" button
Begin Register Patient with middle name
	Open the sidemenu
	Click the "E-Chart" sidemenu entry
	Click the "Patient Registration" charttab
	Type "Kennedy" in the "Last Name" input
	Type "John" in the "First Name" input
	Type "Fitzgerald" in the "Middle Name" input
	Enter "05-29-1917" into the "Birth Date" date
	Click the "Add New" button
	Wait for ajax
	Verify exists "Kennedy, John Fitzgerald" text